chromium-roots

The generated root certificate data and associated metadata are derived from
the Chromium project and retain Chromium's BSD 3-Clause license. The exact
source revision and files are recorded in chromium-crs/data/SOURCE.toml and the generated
crate documentation.

The certificate validation tests are independently adapted from the testing
approach used by rustls/webpki-roots:
https://github.com/rustls/webpki-roots

The rustls/webpki-roots tooling is licensed under Apache-2.0 OR MIT. Its CCADB
certificate data is not copied into this repository.
